  "design_notes": [
    "Two-tone strategy: Lead Pipe gray on topper and reveal frames a satin black cabinet body, giving the stack a layered architectural read rather than one flat slab.",
    "Cherry red is the single accent, reserved for the logo and the URL bar, so it carries the night-time pop without competing with itself.",
    "Faux brick base ties the sign to the masonry vernacular of the storage buildings behind it, grounding it as part of the site rather than a stuck-on pole sign.",
